# React Native's Gradle plugin resolver uses Node's require.resolve to find
# @react-native/gradle-plugin. pnpm's default isolated node_modules layout
# breaks that resolution because packages aren't at the flat path the resolver
# expects. `node-linker=hoisted` tells pnpm to install everything flat, which
# is what React Native (and most Android/iOS native tooling) needs.
#
# This is the pnpm-recommended setting for React Native / Expo projects:
# https://pnpm.io/npmrc#node-linker
node-linker=hoisted
